UnitSwapHookLib::GetFlashFee
├── when swapHook is address zero
│   ├── it calls tickSpacingToFee on the factory
│   └── it returns tick-spacing fee from the factory call
└── when swapHook isn't address zero
    ├── when call fails
    │   ├── it calls tickSpacingToFee on the factory
    │   └── it returns tick-spacing fee from the factory call
    ├── when call succeeds but fee is gt fee ceil
    │   └── it returns _SWAP_FEE_CEIL
    └── when call succeeds and fee is leq fee ceil
        └── it returns fee from returndata of the call
